{"The new HTML verification path throws RuntimeException on IO problems instead of using the existing MojoExecutionException flow, which may change how failures are reported/handled by the Maven plugin": 0.8340321779251099, "Anchor-tag validation/sanitization mutates the input string while iterating with a Matcher created from the original value, which can lead to missed matches or incorrect behavior in multi-anchor strings": 0.6402763724327087, "The anchor validation logic validates anchors only in a strict sequential match, which may not be robust for repeated/duplicated anchors and different ordering scenarios": 0.4054935574531555, "English bundle resolution is based on regex replaceAll on absolute paths which can be brittle across different directory layouts and locale naming patterns": 0.6373751759529114, "English bundle file is unconditionally opened without validating file existence, which may cause false failures or mis-resolving the English source file": 0.802588164806366}